      "message": "I thought we were deprecating inter-adapter messages?  Thats part of the reason handle_onu_events was removed.    Triggering the tech-profile configuration after the uni is enable is the right time.   Im just not sure of the mechanism.    Currently any flows pushed from onos are handled in update_flows_bulk / update_flow_table",
