      "writtenOn": "2018-10-26T13:11:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right. The inter-adapter message was deprecated. But, I had to bring it back due to some design problems I was facing.\nThe EAPOL flow is received only by the OpenOlt adapter and not by the BRCM_OpenOmci adapter. I think this is due to the way the Flow Decomposer decomposes controller-bound flow. Since, EAPOL is the first flow received for the subscriber and the ONU adapter is not receiving it, I had to rely on other mechanisms like inter-adapter message to indicate a tech-profile download.\nDo you have any suggestions ?",
      "parentUuid": "333bf442_9906b2ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 275,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 275,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "e58b6748ba2cd0e19230782d69c2ec11eb10517a",
