      "writtenOn": "2018-10-26T14:46:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would be in favor of all flows being created by the controller instead of a default rule that is pushed by the decomposer.  Makes VOLTHA more of a generic OpenFlow switch which is what the main idea is.",
      "parentUuid": "0e03aeca_9058bf03",
